Review this change. `render` is called once per frame with ~20k points.
```java
public String render(List<Point> points) {
    String out = "";
    for (Point p : points) {
        out += formatPoint(p);
    }
    return out;
}

private String formatPoint(Point p) {
    return new StringBuilder().append(p.x).append(",").append(p.y).append(";").toString();
}
```

